# Secrets and local configuration
.env

# Inputs and outputs that are too large or cannot be redistributed (see README, "Data").
# Anchored, so the source package src/trading_agent/data/ is not caught.
# These carry no trailing slash on purpose: `git check-ignore` does not match a
# trailing-slash pattern against a directory that does not exist, and a fresh
# checkout has none of them.
/data
/build
/dist
/external
reports/
*.db
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
*.log
*.bak

